ion-microscopy data. It provides the ability to render the data using different visualization algorithms and perform simple measurements on the point-localization data. It is extensible using simple MATLAB scripts and a number of plugins is already provided with the software itself, including a clustering algorithm and 3D rendering.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Strengths</strong>: intuitive, easy navigation through the point-localization data</p>\n\n<p><strong>Limitations</strong>: no multi-color</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>PALMsiever is a MATLAB-based application that allows the filtering (sieving) and analysis of localization-microscopy data. It provides the ability to render the data using different visualization algorithms and perform simple measurements on the point-localization data. It is extensible using simple MATLAB scripts and a number of plugins is already provided with the software itself, including a clustering algorithm and 3D rendering.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Strengths</strong>: intuitive, easy navigation through the point-localization data</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Limitations</strong>: no multi-color</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-05-03T14:10:42+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2013-10-15T17:54:43+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505204577,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Thomas Pengo, Seamus Holden"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":19,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"a8a58b02-2abc-4749-8aea-b9a6e7086874","url":"/user/19"}],"has_function":[{"target_id":4772,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_2945","url":"/analysis"},{"target_id":4045,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","targ